#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information on the diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian function, visit the [API docs](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-sqd/fermion#diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian).\n"
msgstr "Další informace o funkci diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian najdeš v [dokumentaci API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-sqd/fermion#diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian).\n"
